Going to the office today is not possible.
I take the phone in my hand.
I search for a nearby clinic's number on my mobile.
I find the number and make a call.
"Hello, is this the clinic?" I ask.
A woman speaks from the other side, "Yes, hello madam."
"I want to see the doctor today," I tell her.
"I have caught a cold and my body aches."
"Will I get a morning time today?"
She asks, "Yes, you will, what is your name?"
"My name is Maya," I answer.
"Alright Maya madam, I am confirming your appointment."
"You should come at half past ten in the morning," she says politely.
"Yes, I will come there at half past ten."
"Thank you very much," I say and hang up the phone.
Now I slowly get ready to go out.
